jp:
{p}
あなた達がいれば
子郎君も安心だね！

en:
{p}
With you two around, Jiro-kun will
be fine!

jp:
{p}
そうだよ！ たとえ
世界が別々でも 想いは一緒さ！

en:
{p}
That's right! Even if your worlds are
apart, your hearts are together!

jp:
{p}
君達とは 助けたり
助けられたりだったね！

en:
{p}
We sure took turns saving each other,
didn't we!

{p}
Those guys didn't change one bit. But
somehow, that makes me happy!

jp:
{p}
門土さん 竜馬さん
いろいろありがとう！

en:
{p}
Mondo-san, Ryoma-san, thanks for
everything!

jp:
{p}
ジャックさん
たまには 笑いなよ…

en:
{p}
Jack-san, you should smile once in a
while...

jp:
{p}
ジャックさん
怒らせちゃったかな…？

{p}
もしも再び…か
冗談じゃないや！

{p}
大丈夫 きっと 夏ちゃん
無事だよ！

en:
{p}
It'll be okay. I'm sure Natsu-chan
is safe!

{p}
I'm sorry, {s}...

I couldn't save you...

jp:
{p}
元の世界って そんなにイヤな
ところだったのかな…

en:
{p}
Was our own world really such an awful
place...

{p}
It's better than this world. Because...
you're not here!

{p}
This place... I recognize it, but... is this
really our own world...?

jp:
{p}
本当に ここは
元の世界なんだろうか…？

en:
{p}
The world has started to set itself
right!

jp:
{p}
携帯に…
メールが…

{p}
「黒い月が輝く時
　お逢いしましょう…」

en:
{p}
"When the black moon shines, let us
meet..."
